{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a multimodal, multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion, achieving higher validation accuracy (0.725) compared to the previous avgpool-based configuration (0.706). The result suggests transformer aggregation may improve performance in this setup, though the exact contribution of aggregation versus other factors remains uncertain due to limited direct comparisons. Validation F1 (0.685) is slightly lower than the previous best, indicating potential trade-offs."
}

